WEBVTT

00:18:57.077 --> 00:19:01.394
KFL: Actually, I totally understand
and appreciate the American values,

00:19:01.418 --> 00:19:03.902
and the concerns these parents would have.

00:19:03.926 --> 00:19:08.409
But most Chinese parents
wouldn't have this particular concern,

00:19:08.433 --> 00:19:12.869
because excellence for the children,
in terms of education,

00:19:12.893 --> 00:19:15.139
is so overwhelmingly important.

00:19:15.505 --> 00:19:20.834
I think some parents may also feel
it's a bit unusual,

00:19:20.858 --> 00:19:24.699
and there might be ways to opt out,
some schools might not have it,

00:19:24.723 --> 00:19:27.847
but overall, I think most Chinese parents

00:19:27.871 --> 00:19:33.672
would say giving up some
of this privacy for the students